range c766f44f..e3deada4
The main problem: `--lock-only` still installs uv and a full Python, but init's docs say it installs nothing. The other problem is that the new dev-only Python pin can clash with a language pack's Python version. Neither the lock fix nor the pin is complete yet. I ran all 8 angles myself over the four commits on the branch (`beef9cad`, `e341821c`, `f8afa0e3`, `e3deada4`). As the high-effort contract says, the findings were deduplicated but not verified, so some may be false positives.

